{"4287960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fractal Foundry", "steam_appid": 4287960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4925460], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/f496c72fae1695838e7653553d900f02.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1560 height=158 /></span>Fractal Foundry is a factory-building game where you automate the creation of <strong>fractal megastructures</strong>. Extract, split, assemble, and deliver increasingly complex shapes, from simple cubes to vast recursive constructions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/9d71730ec2f5df662f3cc5b2d8f366f6.poster.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/9d71730ec2f5df662f3cc5b2d8f366f6.webm?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/9d71730ec2f5df662f3cc5b2d8f366f6.mp4?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/0c63b73657bf1c2692ebcefb7511d791.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1560 height=158 /></span>Build  factories that can be <strong>nested inside other factories</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each factory becomes a <strong>reusable module</strong>. Encapsulate complexity and scale production without rebuilding everything. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/405844da89292d2371675b2636d199e7.poster.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/405844da89292d2371675b2636d199e7.webm?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/405844da89292d2371675b2636d199e7.mp4?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/11d8820639cfa5daebb6c9982b1e87a8.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1560 height=158 /></span>Use <strong>loops, conditions, and variables</strong> to program logic-driven systems that grow elegantly... or spiral into glorious spaghetti.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/011465a6ccd8730e9140c27937d8b6ca.poster.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/011465a6ccd8730e9140c27937d8b6ca.webm?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/011465a6ccd8730e9140c27937d8b6ca.mp4?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/2fe3131182b357635630c4b4a2c8af25.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1560 height=158 /></span><strong>Design factories that can embed themselves</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create recursive production chains where factories repeat across multiple levels, growing into complex, self-similar systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/4c536250c54353534ec22d99274472b9.poster.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/4c536250c54353534ec22d99274472b9.webm?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/4c536250c54353534ec22d99274472b9.mp4?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/2fba477ecabeb939fa912ce742e5ef5a.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1560 height=158 /></span>Progress from simple cubes to huge fractal megastructures.    <br>Each challenge invites you to rethink, refine, and improve your factories, as new possibilities unlock along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/dd4b8576c29b963170de9da2accc5436.poster.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/dd4b8576c29b963170de9da2accc5436.webm?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/dd4b8576c29b963170de9da2accc5436.mp4?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/e8d9caf66c54005f5385c6427cc21c04.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1560 height=158 /></span>There are <strong>no energy systems, no costs, no timers, and no penalties</strong>. Resources are unlimited. <br>Focus entirely on creativity, experimentation, and optimization at your own pace.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/f496c72fae1695838e7653553d900f02.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1560 height=158 /></span>Fractal Foundry is a factory-building game where you automate the creation of <strong>fractal megastructures</strong>. Extract, split, assemble, and deliver increasingly complex shapes, from simple cubes to vast recursive constructions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/9d71730ec2f5df662f3cc5b2d8f366f6.poster.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/9d71730ec2f5df662f3cc5b2d8f366f6.webm?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/9d71730ec2f5df662f3cc5b2d8f366f6.mp4?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/0c63b73657bf1c2692ebcefb7511d791.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1560 height=158 /></span>Build  factories that can be <strong>nested inside other factories</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each factory becomes a <strong>reusable module</strong>. Encapsulate complexity and scale production without rebuilding everything. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/405844da89292d2371675b2636d199e7.poster.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/405844da89292d2371675b2636d199e7.webm?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/405844da89292d2371675b2636d199e7.mp4?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/11d8820639cfa5daebb6c9982b1e87a8.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1560 height=158 /></span>Use <strong>loops, conditions, and variables</strong> to program logic-driven systems that grow elegantly... or spiral into glorious spaghetti.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/011465a6ccd8730e9140c27937d8b6ca.poster.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/011465a6ccd8730e9140c27937d8b6ca.webm?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/011465a6ccd8730e9140c27937d8b6ca.mp4?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/2fe3131182b357635630c4b4a2c8af25.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1560 height=158 /></span><strong>Design factories that can embed themselves</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create recursive production chains where factories repeat across multiple levels, growing into complex, self-similar systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/4c536250c54353534ec22d99274472b9.poster.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/4c536250c54353534ec22d99274472b9.webm?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/4c536250c54353534ec22d99274472b9.mp4?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/2fba477ecabeb939fa912ce742e5ef5a.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1560 height=158 /></span>Progress from simple cubes to huge fractal megastructures.    <br>Each challenge invites you to rethink, refine, and improve your factories, as new possibilities unlock along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/dd4b8576c29b963170de9da2accc5436.poster.avif?t=1787434590\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/dd4b8576c29b963170de9da2accc5436.webm?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/dd4b8576c29b963170de9da2accc5436.mp4?t=1787434590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4287960/extras/e8d9caf66c54005f5385c6427cc21c04.avif?t=1787434590\